# Normalise line endings to LF everywhere.
#
# Without this, core.autocrlf=true on Windows checks out CRLF working copies
# while the committed blobs stay LF. Prettier defaults to endOfLine: "lf", so
# `npm run format:check` fails locally on every file while passing in CI (which
# runs on Linux) — a confusing split that hides real formatting problems.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.p8 binary
*.p12 binary
*.jks binary
*.keystore binary
